  "prefLabel": "En 2102.08 Non-affiliated competitor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2102.08 “Non-affiliated competitor” means any entity that is not an affiliate and that is engaged in the sale or marketing of products or services where such product or service is also provided by a competitive affiliate, and includes any non-affiliated energy competitor.\n\nSource. #14519, eff 2-26-26, EXPIRES: 2-26-36",
